      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each grid level to step onto and complete all goal cells. A goal only completes when the carried piece matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation simultaneously; completing all goals advances to the next level, and clearing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs 1 stamina and movement is constrained by walls; the state provides a blocked_directions list that should never be chosen because blocked moves waste a turn. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape tiles cycle shapes 0\u20135 (wrapping), color tiles cycle colors in order orange \u2192 blue \u2192 green \u2192 red \u2192 orange, and rotation tiles rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u00b0 \u2192 90\u00b0 \u2192 180\u00b0 \u2192 270\u00b0 \u2192 0\u00b0). When stamina reaches 0, you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max; losing all lives ends the game. Goals activate and can be completed only by stepping onto them while the piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match the goal requirements."
